  "conclusions": [
    "GetRoot is protected and SwNodeNum does not publicly re-export it; GetParent is public.",
    "GetRoot starts from mpParent and walks to the highest parent, returning null for root/orphan itself without reading numbering caches.",
    "Native SwList owns shown/hidden/original roots for document sections; GetListItem is an existing browser getter, not a native accessor. Existing single shown-root lookup can use public parent links without exposing a new root API.",
    "Explicit SwTextNode RemoveFromList detaches then resets mpNodeNum; subsequent AddToList allocates a new shown SwNodeNum before insertion."
